<title>USA: Candela sees $500,000-$1 million Q4 loss.</title>
<headline>Candela sees $500,000-$1 million Q4 loss.</headline>
<dateline>WAYLAND, Mass. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candela Corp said Tuesday it expected to post a $500,000 to $1 million loss in the fourth quarter ended June 28 because of higher-than-anticipated start-up costs of its new skin care treatment centers.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of laser-based systems also said it expected to post a profit for the full fiscal year, as its core cosmetic and medical device businesses posted strong revenues in the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
